# Alembic revisions land here.
#
# The directory is committed EMPTY on purpose: `alembic revision
# --autogenerate` needs a live database to compare the models against,
# so the first revision is produced on the server against the real one
# and committed back. Without this file git would not carry the
# directory at all, the container's bind mount would create it as root,
# and alembic would then be unable to write into it.
